<title>PHILIPPINES: Benpres proposes 1-for-3 rights offer.</title>
<headline>Benpres proposes 1-for-3 rights offer.</headline>
<text>
<p>MANILA, March 5 (reuter) - Benpres Holdings Corp said on Wednesday it has filed a proposal with the Securities and Exchange Commission to undertake a pre-emptive rights offer that will entitle shareholders to one share for every three shares held.</p>
</text>
